          <span></span>
        </div>
        <div class="project-canvas-wrap">
          <img src="/website/cc3dpreview4.gif" alt="Breast cancer cell simulation" />
        </div>
        <div class="project-card-bottom">
          <div class="project-title">Biological Breast Cancer Simulation</div>
          <div class="project-desc">Developed biological models for breast cancer using Python and Compucell3D. Analyzed simulation results to aid in cancer research and shared findings with lab members.</div>
          <div class="project-tags">
